{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 17,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 680.347,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.105,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that as Alma was journeying from the land of Gideon southward away to the land of Manti,",
      "verse": "17:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.285,
      "end": 13.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, to his astonishment, he met with the sons of Mosiah journeying towards the land of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "17:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 14.095,
      "end": 19.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now these sons of Mosiah were with Alma at the time the angel first appeared unto him;",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 19.337,
      "end": 22.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore Alma did rejoice exceedingly to see his brethren;",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 23.093,
      "end": 25.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and what added more to his joy,",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 25.734,
      "end": 28.195,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were still his brethren in the Lord;",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 28.375,
      "end": 32.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and they had waxed strong in the knowledge of the truth;",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 32.317,
      "end": 35.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were men of a sound understanding",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 35.33,
      "end": 38.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they had searched the scriptures diligently,",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 38.714,
      "end": 40.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might know the word of God.",
      "verse": "17:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 41.67,
      "end": 43.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But this is not all;",
      "verse": "17:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 43.429,
      "end": 47.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they had given themselves to much prayer, and fasting;",
      "verse": "17:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 47.231,
      "end": 49.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they had the spirit of prophecy,",
      "verse": "17:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 50.151,
      "end": 52.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the spirit of revelation,",
      "verse": "17:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 52.792,
      "end": 56.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when they taught, they taught with power and authority of God.",
      "verse": "17:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 57.373,
      "end": 62.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they had been teaching the word of God for the space of fourteen years among the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "17:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 63.126,
      "end": 67.306,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having had much success in bringing many to the knowledge of the truth;",
      "verse": "17:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 67.486,
      "end": 73.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, by the power of their words many were brought before the altar of God, to call on his name",
      "verse": "17:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 73.889,
      "end": 75.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and confess their sins before him.",
      "verse": "17:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 76.473,
      "end": 80.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now these are the circumstances which attended them in their journeyings,",
      "verse": "17:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 80.833,
      "end": 82.969,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they had many afflictions;",
      "verse": "17:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 83.149,
      "end": 86.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did suffer much, both in body and in mind,",
      "verse": "17:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 86.533,
      "end": 91.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "such as hunger, thirst and fatigue, and also much labor in the spirit.",
      "verse": "17:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 92.136,
      "end": 94.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now these were their journeyings:",
      "verse": "17:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 94.266,
      "end": 98.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Having taken leave of their father, Mosiah, in the first year of the judges;",
      "verse": "17:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 99.09,
      "end": 104.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having refused the kingdom which their father was desirous to confer upon them,",
      "verse": "17:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 104.193,
      "end": 106.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also this was the minds of the people;",
      "verse": "17:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 107.288,
      "end": 110.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless they departed out of the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "17:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 110.997,
      "end": 116.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and took their swords, and their spears, and their bows, and their arrows, and their slings;",
      "verse": "17:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 116.843,
      "end": 118.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this they did",
      "verse": "17:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 118.37,
      "end": 122.828,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might provide food for themselves while in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "17:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 123.508,
      "end": 130.706,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they departed into the wilderness with their numbers which they had selected, to go up to the land of Nephi,",
      "verse": "17:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 130.886,
      "end": 133.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to preach the word of God unto the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "17:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 134.12,
      "end": 139.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they journeyed many days in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "17:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 139.316,
      "end": 141.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they fasted much and prayed much",
      "verse": "17:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 141.864,
      "end": 148.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord would grant unto them a portion of his Spirit to go with them, and abide with them,",
      "verse": "17:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 148.917,
      "end": 159.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might be an instrument in the hands of God to bring, if it were possible, their brethren, the Lamanites, to the knowledge of the truth,",
      "verse": "17:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 159.267,
      "end": 164.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the knowledge of the baseness of the traditions of their fathers, which were not correct.",
      "verse": "17:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 165.566,
      "end": 169.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lord did visit them with his Spirit,",
      "verse": "17:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 169.229,
      "end": 170.854,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto them:",
      "verse": "17:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 171.034,
      "end": 172.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Be comforted.",
      "verse": "17:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 172.468,
      "end": 174.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were comforted.",
      "verse": "17:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 174.681,
      "end": 177.189,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord said unto them also:",
      "verse": "17:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 177.369,
      "end": 180.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Go forth among the Lamanites, thy brethren,",
      "verse": "17:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 180.382,
      "end": 182.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and establish my word;",
      "verse": "17:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 182.234,
      "end": 185.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet ye shall be patient in long-suffering and afflictions,",
      "verse": "17:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 185.851,
      "end": 189.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may show forth good examples unto them in me,",
      "verse": "17:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 189.653,
      "end": 194.901,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will make an instrument of thee in my hands unto the salvation of many souls.",
      "verse": "17:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 195.581,
      "end": 201.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the hearts of the sons of Mosiah, and also those who were with them,",
      "verse": "17:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 202.03,
      "end": 206.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "took courage to go forth unto the Lamanites to declare unto them the word of God.",
      "verse": "17:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 207.493,
      "end": 212.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass when they had arrived in the borders of the land of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "17:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 213.106,
      "end": 215.196,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they separated themselves",
      "verse": "17:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 215.376,
      "end": 221.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and departed one from another, trusting in the Lord that they should meet again at the close of their harvest;",
      "verse": "17:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 221.5,
      "end": 225.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they supposed that great was the work which they had undertaken.",
      "verse": "17:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 226.592,
      "end": 228.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And assuredly it was great,",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 228.63,
      "end": 235.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they had undertaken to preach the word of God to a wild and a hardened and a ferocious people;",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 235.312,
      "end": 238.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a people who delighted in murdering the Nephites,",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 238.603,
      "end": 240.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and robbing and plundering them;",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 241.059,
      "end": 246.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their hearts were set upon riches, or upon gold and silver, and precious stones;",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 246.533,
      "end": 250.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet they sought to obtain these things by murdering and plundering,",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 251.125,
      "end": 254.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might not labor for them with their own hands.",
      "verse": "17:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 255.334,
      "end": 257.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus they were a very indolent people,",
      "verse": "17:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 257.836,
      "end": 260.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "many of whom did worship idols,",
      "verse": "17:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 260.338,
      "end": 265.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the curse of God had fallen upon them because of the traditions of their fathers;",
      "verse": "17:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 265.394,
      "end": 272.081,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding the promises of the Lord were extended unto them on the conditions of repentance.",
      "verse": "17:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 272.761,
      "end": 278.427,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, this was the cause for which the sons of Mosiah had undertaken the work,",
      "verse": "17:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 278.607,
      "end": 281.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that perhaps they might bring them unto repentance;",
      "verse": "17:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 282.177,
      "end": 286.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that perhaps they might bring them to know of the plan of redemption.",
      "verse": "17:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 286.758,
      "end": 289.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore they separated themselves one from another,",
      "verse": "17:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 290.003,
      "end": 291.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went forth among them,",
      "verse": "17:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 292.087,
      "end": 296.917,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man alone, according to the word and power of God which was given unto him.",
      "verse": "17:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 297.597,
      "end": 302.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Ammon being the chief among them, or rather he did administer unto them,",
      "verse": "17:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 302.653,
      "end": 304.325,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he departed from them,",
      "verse": "17:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 304.505,
      "end": 308.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after having blessed them according to their several stations,",
      "verse": "17:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 308.679,
      "end": 315.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having imparted the word of God unto them, or administered unto them before his departure;",
      "verse": "17:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 316.104,
      "end": 319.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they took their several journeys throughout the land.",
      "verse": "17:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 320.128,
      "end": 322.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon went to the land of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "17:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 322.816,
      "end": 325.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the land being called after the sons of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "17:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 326.015,
      "end": 327.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who also became Lamanites.",
      "verse": "17:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 328.46,
      "end": 330.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as Ammon entered the land of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 331.148,
      "end": 333.424,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lamanites took him and bound him,",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 333.604,
      "end": 338.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as was their custom to bind all the Nephites who fell into their hands,",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 338.614,
      "end": 340.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and carry them before the king;",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 340.605,
      "end": 344.227,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus it was left to the pleasure of the king to slay them,",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 344.407,
      "end": 347.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or to retain them in captivity,",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 347.234,
      "end": 349.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or to cast them into prison,",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 349.597,
      "end": 354.845,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or to cast them out of his land, according to his will and pleasure.",
      "verse": "17:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 355.525,
      "end": 360.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus Ammon was carried before the king who was over the land of Ishmael;",
      "verse": "17:21",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 360.767,
      "end": 362.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his name was Lamoni;",
      "verse": "17:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 362.619,
      "end": 365.313,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was a descendant of Ishmael.",
      "verse": "17:21",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 365.993,
      "end": 367.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king inquired of Ammon",
      "verse": "17:22",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 368.123,
      "end": 372.303,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it were his desire to dwell in the land among the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "17:22",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 372.483,
      "end": 374.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or among his people.",
      "verse": "17:22",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 374.696,
      "end": 376.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon said unto him:",
      "verse": "17:23",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 376.734,
      "end": 379.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I desire to dwell among this people for a time;",
      "verse": "17:23",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 379.979,
      "end": 382.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and perhaps until the day I die.",
      "verse": "17:23",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 383.213,
      "end": 387.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that king Lamoni was much pleased with Ammon,",
      "verse": "17:24",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 387.712,
      "end": 390.313,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and caused that his bands should be loosed;",
      "verse": "17:24",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 390.493,
      "end": 394.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he would that Ammon should take one of his daughters to wife.",
      "verse": "17:24",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 394.981,
      "end": 396.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Ammon said unto him:",
      "verse": "17:25",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 396.972,
      "end": 399.294,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nay, but I will be thy servant.",
      "verse": "17:25",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 399.474,
      "end": 402.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore Ammon became a servant to king Lamoni.",
      "verse": "17:25",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 402.765,
      "end": 412.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he was set among other servants to watch the flocks of Lamoni, according to the custom of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "17:25",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 413.522,
      "end": 417.284,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after he had been in the service of the king three days,",
      "verse": "17:26",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 417.464,
      "end": 426.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as he was with the Lamanitish servants going forth with their flocks to the place of water, which was called the water of Sebus,",
      "verse": "17:26",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 426.421,
      "end": 429.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all the Lamanites drive their flocks hither,",
      "verse": "17:26",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 429.434,
      "end": 431.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may have water\u2014",
      "verse": "17:26",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 431.972,
      "end": 439.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, as Ammon and the servants of the king were driving forth their flocks to this place of water,",
      "verse": "17:27",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 439.536,
      "end": 441.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, a certain number of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "17:27",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 442.131,
      "end": 444.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had been with their flocks to water,",
      "verse": "17:27",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 444.912,
      "end": 449.602,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "stood and scattered the flocks of Ammon and the servants of the king,",
      "verse": "17:27",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 449.782,
      "end": 453.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they scattered them insomuch that they fled many ways.",
      "verse": "17:27",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 453.945,
      "end": 457.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the servants of the king began to murmur, saying:",
      "verse": "17:28",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 457.283,
      "end": 460.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the king will slay us, as he has our brethren",
      "verse": "17:28",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 460.342,
      "end": 465.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because their flocks were scattered by the wickedness of these men.",
      "verse": "17:28",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 465.491,
      "end": 468.231,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they began to weep exceedingly, saying:",
      "verse": "17:28",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 468.411,
      "end": 471.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, our flocks are scattered already.",
      "verse": "17:28",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 471.831,
      "end": 475.082,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now they wept because of the fear of being slain.",
      "verse": "17:29",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 475.262,
      "end": 479.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when Ammon saw this his heart was swollen within him with joy;",
      "verse": "17:29",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 479.529,
      "end": 481.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for, said he,",
      "verse": "17:29",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 481.242,
      "end": 484.911,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will show forth my power unto these my fellow-servants,",
      "verse": "17:29",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 485.091,
      "end": 489.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the power which is in me, in restoring these flocks unto the king,",
      "verse": "17:29",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 489.636,
      "end": 493.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may win the hearts of these my fellow-servants,",
      "verse": "17:29",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 493.206,
      "end": 495.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may lead them to believe in my words.",
      "verse": "17:29",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 496.254,
      "end": 498.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, these were the thoughts of Ammon,",
      "verse": "17:30",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 498.756,
      "end": 502.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when he saw the afflictions of those whom he termed to be his brethren.",
      "verse": "17:30",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 503.476,
      "end": 507.191,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he flattered them by his words, saying:",
      "verse": "17:31",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 507.371,
      "end": 508.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My brethren,",
      "verse": "17:31",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 508.758,
      "end": 510.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "be of good cheer",
      "verse": "17:31",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 510.238,
      "end": 512.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and let us go in search of the flocks,",
      "verse": "17:31",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 512.833,
      "end": 514.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we will gather them together",
      "verse": "17:31",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 514.917,
      "end": 517.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bring them back unto the place of water;",
      "verse": "17:31",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 517.883,
      "end": 522.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus we will preserve the flocks unto the king and he will not slay us.",
      "verse": "17:31",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 522.975,
      "end": 526.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they went in search of the flocks,",
      "verse": "17:32",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 526.638,
      "end": 528.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did follow Ammon,",
      "verse": "17:32",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 528.629,
      "end": 531.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they rushed forth with much swiftness",
      "verse": "17:32",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 531.456,
      "end": 533.824,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did head the flocks of the king,",
      "verse": "17:32",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 534.004,
      "end": 537.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did gather them together again to the place of water.",
      "verse": "17:32",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 538.121,
      "end": 541.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And those men again stood to scatter their flocks;",
      "verse": "17:33",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 541.459,
      "end": 543.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but Ammon said unto his brethren:",
      "verse": "17:33",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 543.915,
      "end": 547.305,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Encircle the flocks round about that they flee not;",
      "verse": "17:33",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 547.485,
      "end": 551.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I go and contend with these men who do scatter our flocks.",
      "verse": "17:33",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 552.159,
      "end": 555.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, they did as Ammon commanded them,",
      "verse": "17:34",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 555.218,
      "end": 559.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he went forth and stood to contend with those who stood by the waters of Sebus;",
      "verse": "17:34",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 559.67,
      "end": 562.41,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were in number not a few.",
      "verse": "17:34",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 563.09,
      "end": 565.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore they did not fear Ammon,",
      "verse": "17:35",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 565.592,
      "end": 569.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they supposed that one of their men could slay him according to their pleasure,",
      "verse": "17:35",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 569.998,
      "end": 576.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they knew not that the Lord had promised Mosiah that he would deliver his sons out of their hands;",
      "verse": "17:35",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 576.865,
      "end": 579.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither did they know anything concerning the Lord;",
      "verse": "17:35",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 580.064,
      "end": 583.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they delighted in the destruction of their brethren;",
      "verse": "17:35",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 583.959,
      "end": 587.442,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for this cause they stood to scatter the flocks of the king.",
      "verse": "17:35",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 588.122,
      "end": 592.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Ammon stood forth and began to cast stones at them with his sling;",
      "verse": "17:36",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 592.992,
      "end": 596.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, with mighty power he did sling stones amongst them;",
      "verse": "17:36",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 596.655,
      "end": 603.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus he slew a certain number of them insomuch that they began to be astonished at his power;",
      "verse": "17:36",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 603.429,
      "end": 608.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they were angry because of the slain of their brethren,",
      "verse": "17:36",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 608.439,
      "end": 610.9,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were determined that he should fall;",
      "verse": "17:36",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 611.08,
      "end": 615.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, seeing that they could not hit him with their stones,",
      "verse": "17:36",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 615.393,
      "end": 617.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they came forth with clubs to slay him.",
      "verse": "17:36",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 618.488,
      "end": 622.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, every man that lifted his club to smite Ammon,",
      "verse": "17:37",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 622.43,
      "end": 624.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he smote off their arms with his sword;",
      "verse": "17:37",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 625.164,
      "end": 633.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he did withstand their blows by smiting their arms with the edge of his sword, insomuch that they began to be astonished,",
      "verse": "17:37",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 633.796,
      "end": 635.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to flee before him;",
      "verse": "17:37",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 636.066,
      "end": 638.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and they were not few in number;",
      "verse": "17:37",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 638.614,
      "end": 641.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he caused them to flee by the strength of his arm.",
      "verse": "17:37",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 642.545,
      "end": 645.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now six of them had fallen by the sling,",
      "verse": "17:38",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 645.372,
      "end": 648.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he slew none save it were their leader with his sword;",
      "verse": "17:38",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 648.989,
      "end": 653.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he smote off as many of their arms as were lifted against him,",
      "verse": "17:38",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 653.767,
      "end": 655.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were not a few.",
      "verse": "17:38",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 656.072,
      "end": 659.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when he had driven them afar off, he returned",
      "verse": "17:39",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 659.735,
      "end": 664.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they watered their flocks and returned them to the pasture of the king,",
      "verse": "17:39",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 664.884,
      "end": 674.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then went in unto the king, bearing the arms which had been smitten off by the sword of Ammon, of those who sought to slay him;",
      "verse": "17:39",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 674.491,
      "end": 679.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were carried in unto the king for a testimony of the things which they had done.",
      "verse": "17:39",
      "lineIndex": 176
    }
  ]
}